This JavaScript function should return the average of an array of numbers (0 for an empty array), but it has bugs. Fix it and return the corrected function with the same name.

```javascript
function average(nums) {
  let total = 0;
  for (let i = 1; i <= nums.length; i++) total += nums[i];
  return total / (nums.length - 1);
}
```
